invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_test
reason: a server's ch_read takes a NewSessionTicket the client sent, which
  RFC 9846 section 4.7.1 gives the server alone to send, and a server whose
  on_ticket is set derives a PSK from its own resumption secret and hands
  it over. bin/tcp_nonblocking_loop_test requires unexpected_message and no
  on_ticket call.

--- old
    if (t->server != 0) {
        return CH_EPROTO;
    }
--- new
    (void)t;
